@Order.HostAddress = http://localhost:5005

### 1. Register a user
POST {{Order.HostAddress}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Demo User", "login": "demo", "password": "Demo@1234", "confirmPassword": "Demo@1234" }

### 2. Authenticate (copy the token from the response)
POST {{Order.HostAddress}}/api/user/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "demo", "password": "Demo@1234" }

### 3. List clients
GET {{Order.HostAddress}}/api/client
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
